### ============================================================
### BISTU 教务系统 API 测试
### ============================================================

@base_sso = https://sso.bistu.edu.cn
@base_uc = https://uc.bistu.edu.cn
@base_jwxt = https://jwxt.bistu.edu.cn

@termCode = 2025-2026-3

### ---- SSO 统一认证 ----

### 获取 SM2 公钥
GET {{base_sso}}/api/reset/rules

### 初始化 session（获取 flowKey）
GET {{base_sso}}/login?service=https%3A%2F%2Fuc.bistu.edu.cn%2Fapi%2Flogin%3Ftarget%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fuc.bistu.edu.cn%252Fuser%252Flogin

### 查询是否需要验证码
POST {{base_sso}}/info-query
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"","flowKey":""}

### 登录（密码需 SM2 加密）
POST {{base_sso}}/username-password/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"flowKey":"{{flowKey}}","username":"{{username}}","password":"{{encrypted}}"}

### ---- UC 用户中心 ----

### 用户状态
GET {{base_uc}}/api/uc/status?selfTimestamp={{$timestamp}}

### 用户详细信息
GET {{base_uc}}/api/uc/userinfo?selfTimestamp={{$timestamp}}

### ---- 教务系统（先 GET casLogin.do 建立 session）----

### SSO → JWXT 桥接
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/yjsrzfwapp/bistuLogin/casLogin.do

### 当前学期
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/jwpubapp/modules/gg/cxmrxnxq.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

CSDM=SYS&ZCSDM=DQXNXQDM&SFSY=1

### 全量学期列表 🆕（HomePage 下拉框数据源）
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/homeapp/api/home/kb/xnxq.do

### 教学周
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbbpapp/api/schoolCalendar/getTermWeeks.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}

### 校区
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbapp/api/wdkbcx/getMyScheduledCampus.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}

### 节次
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbapp/api/wdkbcx/getMySectionList.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}&XQDM=10

### 课表 ⭐
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbapp/api/wdkbcx/getMyScheduleDetail.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}&XQDM=10

### 考试安排 ⭐
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/wdkwapp/api/wdks/queryMyExamArrangeMent.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}

### 星期
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbbpapp/api/kbbp/cxxqzd.do

### 课表确认设置
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/kbapp/api/wdkbcx/scheduleConfirmationSetting.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

XNXQDM={{termCode}}

### ---- 教室借用 / 空闲教室 ----

### 教室借用模块首页（获取 Cookie）
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/jsjy/*default/index.do?THEME=indigo&EMAP_LANG=zh&forceApp=jsjy

### 字典：校区
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/83a986fc-e677-400e-99a4-c7bb39c2ca35.do

### 字典：教学楼
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/ebb0e845-6ae0-44ab-aa5d-4b9f57ed111d.do

### 字典：教室类型
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/9edfd823-1f71-4bb6-b002-9fb1fb8c4b2b.do

### 字典：教室类型（备用）
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/aa53c930-f7a2-43b4-af6a-d91e96504556.do

### 字典：管理单位
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/a13e88da-06f0-4fa3-a01e-23795373f284.do

### 字典：学年学期
GET {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/code/1daca2c6-abd2-4278-af49-5af038db0926.do

### 查询空闲教室 ⭐ (沙河校区，2026-07-05 ~ 2026-07-06，19:30-23:30)
POST {{base_jwxt}}/jwapp/sys/jsjy/modules/jsjysq/cxkxjs.do
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8

querySetting=%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22XXXQDM%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%A0%A1%E5%8C%BA%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_List%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22equal%22%2C%22value%22%3A%2210%22%2C%22value_display%22%3A%22%E6%B2%99%E6%B2%B3%E6%A0%A1%E5%8C%BA%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22KSRQ%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_String%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22include%22%2C%22value%22%3A%222026-07-05%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22JSRQ%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_String%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22include%22%2C%22value%22%3A%222026-07-06%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22KSSJ%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_String%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22include%22%2C%22value%22%3A%2219%3A30%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22JSSJ%22%2C%22capiton%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_String%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22include%22%2C%22value%22%3A%2223%3A30%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22SKZWS%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8A%E8%AF%BE%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22linkOpt%22%3A%22AND%22%2C%22builderList%22%3A%22cbl_Other%22%2C%22builder%22%3A%22moreEqual%22%2C%22value%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22DZLYLX%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22JSJY%22%7D%5D&KSRQ=2026-07-05&JSRQ=2026-07-06&KSSJ=19%3A30&JSSJ=23%3A30&*order=%2BLC%2C%2BSKZWS%2C%2BWID&pageSize=10&pageNumber=1
